# CI-001: GitHub Actions Workflow

**Status**: Not Started
**Priority**: High (Deployment automation)
**Estimated effort**: 1 hour

## User Need

As a user, I need the newsletter automation to run automatically every Monday at 08:00 UTC so I don't have to manually trigger it, with logs available if it fails.

## Context

Implements GitHub Actions workflow for automated batch execution. Runs on schedule (cron) + manual trigger (workflow_dispatch). Uploads logs on failure for debugging.

**Parent plan**: `.claude/inputs/Plan détaillé newsletter automatisée (Node js + Ty 2c7fe971789a801282bee743ae7c3635.md` (Phase 8.1)

